                "y",
                "x"
            ],
            "comment": "The estimated rainfall amount (kg m-2) is equivalent to the rainfall depth (mm). It is estimated where the closest raingauge is within 100km, otherwise not estimated and value set to -2. According to the British Standards Institution (BS 7843-4:2012), UK convention is for calculations of areal rainfall to be based on total measured precipitation, where measured precipitation includes both rainfall and the water equivalent of new snow. ",
